    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join us on Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720820/extras/2bb14659ca8ef5bebf87cef9349693d0.poster.avif?t=1752069781\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720820/extras/2bb14659ca8ef5bebf87cef9349693d0.webm?t=1752069781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720820/extras/5257703409706f9fa127aae85f791e98.poster.avif?t=1752069781\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720820/extras/5257703409706f9fa127aae85f791e98.webm?t=1752069781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Emma, a to-be journalist, and Patrick, a junior software developer, as they try their luck in the Big Apple. Needing a leg up, they move in with Martin, a professional photographer and an old friend of Patrick\u2019s father. The prospect of a fresh start in a big city pushes the couple to never-before explored spots in their relationship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you dare to explore the deepest parts of their minds, or will you watch the play unfold from the sidelines? The choice will <i>always </i>be yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720820/extras/17ea2dbde3628875cbc6c152832644fe.poster.avif?t=1752069781\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720820/extras/17ea2dbde3628875cbc6c152832644fe.webm?t=1752069781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The decisions you make whist Exploring the Big Apple will have consequences you can see play out as the game progresses. Every pick has a tangible impact on the story and how the relationship between the unlikely trio develops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No single playthrough will be the same, as multiple paths spell the fate of the young couple and their new host. Be proactive or stay passive \u2013 no wrong choices, only plenty of delicious fun\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720820/extras/1074be7f414ce71d6a55516fef9b7fbc.poster.avif?t=1752069781\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720820/extras/1074be7f414ce71d6a55516fef9b7fbc.webm?t=1752069781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Exploring the Big Apple, you will inevitably find:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf 2600+ renders in 1080p.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Over 25 immersive animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf 5+ hours of delectable gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf A script of over 180 thousand words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Interactive gallery of the in-game photo shoots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720820/extras/197f1d51c33844cf49b36f17d871f12c.poster.avif?t=1752069781\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720820/extras/197f1d51c33844cf49b36f17d871f12c.webm?t=1752069781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
