 proactive or stay passive \u2013 no wrong choices, only plenty of delicious fun\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720820/extras/1074be7f414ce71d6a55516fef9b7fbc.poster.avif?t=1752069781\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720820/extras/1074be7f414ce71d6a55516fef9b7fbc.webm?t=1752069781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Exploring the Big Apple, you will inevitably find:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf 2600+ renders in 1080p.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Over 25 immersive animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf 5+ hours of delectable gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf A script of over 180 thousand words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Interactive gallery of the in-game photo shoots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720820/extras/197f1d51c33844cf49b36f17d871f12c.poster.avif?t=1752069781\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720820/extras/197f1d51c33844cf49b36f17d871f12c.webm?t=1752069781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
